      "text": "Step 2 cleanup subcheck C32 passed independent review. The cleanup covers removing unused conformances and identifiers, deleting inactive web-prototype caches and Finder metadata, relocating and preserving two Foundation .xcresult bundles with verified member hashes and relative symlinks, removing generated Swift build/SDK/index caches after checks, hardlink-deduplicating 69 byte-identical audit payload aliases while retaining manifest paths and bytes, and removing two xcresulttool SQLite read caches. Source: docs/tasks/2026-11-14-complete-interface-demo.md. | When: Saturday, November 14, 2026 | Involving: memoryos project team | C32 adds dead-code and junk cleanup to Step 2 and the standing workflow/template; the overall Step 2 status remains blocked by required checks.",
